<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. I have included some information below to help you with the transfer process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">You can review our <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/transferrequirements">transfer admission requirements</a> online. Some majors have additional requirements, which can be viewed by searching for your major on <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/">degree search</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To transfer to ASU, your first step is to <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/apply">apply for admission</a> and pay the application fee online. After you have submitted your application, contact your high school and all colleges you have previously attended to request official transcripts be sent directly to ASU Admission Services. ASU requires an official high school transcript if you have <b>not completed</b> an associate degree or bachelor's degree <b>at the time you apply</b>. Once we receive all materials, your file will be reviewed for admission. The review process may take up to 4 – 6 weeks.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">After you apply to ASU, you will receive an email and a letter containing your ASURITE UserID and activation code. Follow the instructions to activate your <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> account. You will be able to track your admission status on My ASU.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Once admitted to ASU, you must meet with an academic advisor in your major and submit MMR immunization records to our student health office, prior to registering for classes. Instructions for these and other next steps can be found <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/steps">here</a>, including how to get your ASU ID card, apply for financial aid and scholarships, purchase a parking permit, pay tuition and more.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you have any questions, let me know and I will be happy to help.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>